      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodega_Bay%2C_California",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Erden Eruç completed the first entirely solo, human‑powered circumnavigation of the Earth right here in Bodega Bay.",
